        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5023 Knob With 5059 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>Fashioned in the style of days gone by, this knob and rose set made by Baldwin is the perfect finishing touch to period style homes. The rustic 5059 Rose paired with the simple yet elegant 5023 Knob makes this solid brass knobset a little taste of old world architecture, art, and hardware; but it is made with the attention to quality that Baldwin is known for and is backed by a lifetime limited warranty. It is large enough to cover a 2-1/8\" pre-cut bore holes; and it will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5023 Old World Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Rustic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.93\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Old World Knobset, Baldwin 5023",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5023 Knob with 5059 Rosette - Fashioned in the style of days gone by, this knob and rose set made by Baldwin is the perfect finishing touch to period style homes. The rustic 5059 Rose paired with the simple yet elegant 5023 Knob makes this solid brass knobset a little taste of old world architecture, art, and hardware; but it is made with the attention to quality that Baldwin is known for and is backed by a lifetime limited warranty. It is large enough to cover a 2-1/8 inch pre-cut bore holes; and it will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5023, Baldwin old world knobsets, Bladwin 5023 Knobs, baldwin 5059 roses, Baldwin 5059 rosettes, solid brass knobsets, old world knobs, baldwin 5023 knobsets, baldwin estates collection, traditional door knobs, rustic door knobs, classic door knobs, victorian door knobs,"
